# Ignored: scratch output a CLI run drops here.

# `bin/read-figure.mjs` writes its handoff next to the figure by default. That is
# the right default for a person reading a paper, and the wrong thing to commit,
# so the directory is ignored wholesale rather than file by file.
/out/

# The figures the pixel-layer assertions run against are somebody else's exam
# paper, so they are not redistributed here. Drop your own copies in fixtures/
# or point READ_FIGURE_FIXTURES at a directory; see fixtures/README.md.
/fixtures/*.jpg
/fixtures/*.jpeg
/fixtures/*.png

node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
*.tgz

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
